   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO incl IHP+</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WHO incl IHP+</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till WHO som &#xe4;r FN&#xb4;s tekniska organ f&#xf6;r global h&#xe4;lsa med ett     starkt mandat f&#xf6;r normativ verksamhet;  t ex &#xf6;verenskommelser mellan  stater om h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rdande &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder (konventioner),st&#xf6;d till regeringar, upplysning i h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rdsfr&#xe5;gor. Grundvalen f&#xf6;r verksamheten &#xe4;r         evidensbaserad.Sida&#xb4;s st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r icke &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt utan st&#xf6;djer WHO&#xb4;s alla  12 m&#xe5;lomr&#xe5;den inom programbudgeten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to WHO as the UN technical agency in global health with a     strong mandate for normative work such as, agreements on health       interventions (conventions), support to governments and health        promotion. The basis of WHO&#xb4;s work is evidence based. The support     from Sida is non-earmarked which means that Sida supports the entire  programme budget consisting of 12 strategic objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
